<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:45:41 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>尽管 Panmure Liberum 分析师发出震惊警告，但全球股市仍上涨，该分析师出售了其个人投资组合中的所有股票</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/global-stocks-move-upward-despite-shock-warning-from-panmure-liberum-to-sell-all-equities-now/</link><description>多名华尔街和伦敦金融城分析师在给《财富》杂志的电子邮件中表示，即将到来的只有坏消息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-1211350756.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:47:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/global-stocks-move-upward-despite-shock-warning-from-panmure-liberum-to-sell-all-equities-now/</guid></item><item><title>“史诗般的失败”：加密世界抨击 Netflix 的《利他主义者》将 SBF 的罪行变成了爱情故事</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/an-epic-fail-crypto-world-blasts-netflixs-the-altruists-for-turning-sbfs-crimes-into-a-love-story/</link><description>熟悉 FTX 故事的人士表示，这部奥巴马支持的纪录片依靠反华比喻来转移萨姆·班克曼-弗里德的责任。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/The-Altruists.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/an-epic-fail-crypto-world-blasts-netflixs-the-altruists-for-turning-sbfs-crimes-into-a-love-story/</guid></item><item><title>Reddit 的股价今年遭受了重创，但其首席运营官表示，它才刚刚开始从忠实用户那里积累“十多年的业力”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/reddit-coo-jen-wong-user-karma-moderator-model-ai/</link><description>“Reddit 通常会吸引你作为一个年轻人，然后你会以这种令人难以置信的方式随着时间的推移而成长，”Jen Wong 告诉《财富》杂志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2213132412-e1795707183910.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:46:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/reddit-coo-jen-wong-user-karma-moderator-model-ai/</guid></item><item><title>丝芙兰美国首席执行官最初拒绝了该公司的初级职位，因为她只能穿黑色、白色或灰色衣服去办公室</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/sephora-ceo-declined-role-dress-code-monochrome/</link><description>丝芙兰首席执行官阿特米斯·帕特里克（Artemis Patrick）在计划香烟销售和穿单色衣服去办公室之间犹豫不决，最终选择了前者。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305126052-e1795103352480.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/sephora-ceo-declined-role-dress-code-monochrome/</guid></item><item><title>美国运通公司向英国小企业主赠送 130 万美元现金，不附加任何条件</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/american-express-is-giving-away-1-3-million-cash-to-british-small-business-owners-grant-apply-founders/</link><description>随着人工智能扼杀了稳定工作和角落办公室的梦想，数百万人开始自己创业——美国运通为他们投入了 130 万美元&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2219497251-e1795696790819.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:36:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/american-express-is-giving-away-1-3-million-cash-to-british-small-business-owners-grant-apply-founders/</guid></item><item><title>DoorDash 全球食品获取负责人：饥饿不会休假。把食物放到餐桌上需要我们所有人的努力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/doordash-hunger-holiday-snap-food-banks-project-dash/</link><description>没有任何一个组织能够缩小这一差距。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/daniel-riff.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/doordash-hunger-holiday-snap-food-banks-project-dash/</guid></item><item><title>马克·库班支持的一家人工智能初创公司正在帮助家庭将与年长亲戚的感恩节对话变成持久的记忆</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/mark-cuban-ai-startups-remento-kindred-tales-future-of-work-tech-thanksgiving-2026/</link><description>随着 8150 万美国人出行过感恩节，一类新型人工智能初创公司正在帮助人们保存年迈亲人的记忆。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Charlie-on-Shark-Tank-side.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:38:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/mark-cuban-ai-startups-remento-kindred-tales-future-of-work-tech-thanksgiving-2026/</guid></item><item><title>为什么企业正在拥抱“足够好”的开放式人工智能——以及地缘政治如何阻碍</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/global-businesses-open-weight-ai/</link><description>公司不再为每项任务购买最强大的人工智能模型，而是转向更便宜、可定制的替代方案来完成日常工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2298411035.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/global-businesses-open-weight-ai/</guid></item><item><title>尽管收入创纪录，亚马逊领取食品券的工人数量却增加了两倍——这只是新经济时代劳动力份额萎缩的最新证据</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/why-have-amazon-workers-on-food-stamps-tripled-despite-its-record-revenue-shrinking-labor-share/</link><description>一位政策专家表示：“这些家庭确实勉强维持收支平衡。” “但他们仍在工作，而且工作很多。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1186028642-e1789150326930.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:32:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/why-have-amazon-workers-on-food-stamps-tripled-despite-its-record-revenue-shrinking-labor-share/</guid></item><item><title>美国财政部面临着一个不同寻常的国债难题：GLP-1 造成 180 亿美元的缺口，家庭每年在食品杂货上的支出减少 500 美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/us-treasury-weight-loss-budget-deficit-drugs/</link><description>牛津经济研究院指出：“从净值来看，我们估计到 2034 年，用于减肥的 GLP-1 医疗保险覆盖范围将导致赤字增加近 180 亿美元。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2306101345-e1795694339387.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:18:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/26/us-treasury-weight-loss-budget-deficit-drugs/</guid></item></channel></rss>